{%- comment -%} Lumisca — FAQ accordion (hardcoded, native details/summary) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- style -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq { padding: 4.4rem 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__title { font-size: 2.8rem; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 2.6rem; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__list { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(138,128,120,.26); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__q { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem; padding: 1.8rem 0; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 600; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__icon { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; position: relative; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__icon::before, #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__icon::after { content: ''; position: absolute; background: #C8622E; border-radius: 2px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__icon::before { top: 50%; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__icon::after { left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px; transform: translateX(-50%); transition: opacity .2s ease; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__item[open] .flame-faq__icon::after { opacity: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__a { padding: 0 0 1.8rem; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; opacity: .92; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__a p { margin: 0; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq { padding: 6.4rem 0; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .flame-faq__title { font-size: 3.6rem; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="color-scheme-1 gradient">
  <div class="page-width flame-faq">
    <h2 class="flame-faq__title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="flame-faq__list">
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>How does the flame work?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>It's an illusion made of cool mist lit by warm LEDs — no fire, smoke or heat. You get the dancing glow of a flame with none of the risk.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>Is it safe to leave on?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>Yes. There's no real flame, and it automatically shuts off when the water runs low — so it's safe to leave running overnight or around kids and pets.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>Do I need essential oils?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>Not at all. It works beautifully with water alone for the flame glow and mist. Add a few drops of your favourite oil whenever you'd like some aromatherapy.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>How long does delivery take (UK/IE)?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days. Typical delivery is around 7–20 days depending on your location. You'll get tracking as soon as it ships.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>What's the runtime and tank size?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>The ~120ml tank gives around 5 hours of continuous cosy glow and mist per fill.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="flame-faq__item">
        <summary class="flame-faq__q"><span>What's your return policy?</span><span class="flame-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="flame-faq__a"><p>You're covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee. If it's not for you, contact us within 30 days for a full refund.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Flame FAQ", "tag": "section", "class": "flame-section", "settings": [], "presets": [ { "name": "Flame FAQ" } ] }
{% endschema %}
